# Flat pale sky-blue backdrop: untextured (a plain Kd tint is enough for a
# distant sky plane), fully rough so it doesn't pick up a distracting
# specular highlight — this engine has no real skybox/atmosphere system, so
# a large tinted box far behind the outdoor props is a cheap stand-in for
# "there's sky back there" instead of the renderer's own dark clear color
# showing through as a void.
newmtl sky
Kd 0.55 0.72 0.92
Pr 1.0
Pm 0.0
